in Annex Xb, the introductory sentence is replaced by the following:


                              ‘Together with the information contained in the annual emission report pursuant to Annex X to this Regulation, the regulated entity shall submit the following information for each purchased fuel as defined in Article 3, point (af), of Directive 2003/87/EC:’
